hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-53 = cons "**What the line was building toward.** Ceptr aimed at distributed sense-making: a substrate where meaning, agreement" (cons "and value could be computed among people without silos. A knowledge graph whose objects carry their meaning, whose" (cons "edges carry their rationale, whose identities carry what they preserve, and whose validity is local and provable is" (cons "the completion of that program, with the mathematics it pointed at: univalence for meaning across representations," (cons "warrants for knowledge under partial observation, and maintained views for currency over time." (cons "" nil)))))
